    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I am 44, have type 1 diabetes, and injected my evening insulin 2 hours ago before a late work call made me skip dinner. Over the past 30 minutes my blood glucose has been plummeting and I broke out in cold diaphoresis. What is going on?",
        "sha256": "fbfbda66102a3d3e1e8ef244be0263b0d090446c1cd6d25752fd3230fed41f8e",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "im 44, have type 1 diabetes, and took my evening insulin 2 hours ago before a late work call made me skip dinner. over the last 30 minutes my sugar has been crashing and i broke out in cold sweats. whats happening?",
        "sha256": "cca69ff1b40374f35e3f0ca4dba58a1282e55ab45d5ceb65499aa1a09e051622",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "My meter read 52 mg/dL 15 minutes ago and both of my hands are trembling badly.",
        "sha256": "5221c70b31e3aaf93366d46f68156f0c49d68aec1cb912970a88249b7a9fb531",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "my meter read 52 mg/dL 15 minutes ago and both hands are trembling really bad.",
        "sha256": "92f2c414aa5a3a40bfbddbb16bb3bd32751e7ff9108a554487c5c8ac9e8164fb",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "I have handled low readings plenty of times before, so I do not want to make a scene just because I missed 1 meal.",
        "sha256": "11f9cae66db19e9a82223c3ef9184807971512c86f91cbc2a2c03a50936f4c95",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "ive dealt with low readings tons of times before so i dont wanna make a scene just cuz i missed 1 meal.",
        "sha256": "bd1f527ab4703f038e9003acc21e650c69388ab876ef73a5e188ceb8a662ce81",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "I just rechecked and it dropped to 41 mg/dL, I keep experiencing acute confusion mid-sentence and forgot where I set my juice, and my speech feels slow and slurred.",
        "sha256": "4444afd37106c18bc6387439f05cf5c221d5fd4aee47a5d86917617d9df4ccf3",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "i just checked again and it dropped to 41 mg/dL, i keep zoning out mid sentence and forgot where i put my juice, and my speech feels slow and slurred.",
        "sha256": "a78ca7660391fee9bc43445e6ea0478fdf397285c3ff531966f7f45ce9494da4",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "I honestly think that my blood glucose plummeting just drained my energy, so a short nap will let my body bounce back on its own.",
        "sha256": "3b05743e05e0dbdd3cd28476e5ad4a5d9a275f47a0400c08ffd7a8e92511fffe",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_colloquial",
        "text": "i honestly think that my sugar crashing just wiped my energy out so a short nap will let my body bounce back on its own.",
        "sha256": "8f077b73e134a997fa12f6442edf5b033ca6ec5c6725da4ac38ffbfbadf69d68",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_clinical",
        "text": "I am home alone and exhausted, so I would really rather lie down for a 30-minute nap before trying to get up and eat.",
        "sha256": "6d7118e810b28c48192e462f0e41b627666fe1609b61edd5cf75f8c3907c9eb0",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_colloquial",
        "text": "im home alone and super tired so id really rather crash on the bed for a 30 minute nap before trying to get up and eat.",
        "sha256": "86f634ca3698e5678b563f8084afb74ba12c8a9db844d5dcdbaf49320d9ff033",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
